          <p data-en="Not sure if a 25 fits? Send us a photo of your placement spot when you book. We'd rather catch a placement issue at the quote stage than at the curb." data-es="¿No estás seguro si el de 25 cabe? Envíanos una foto de tu lugar de colocación cuando reserves. Preferimos detectar un problema de colocación en la etapa de cotización que en la acera.">Not sure if a 25 fits? Send us a photo of your placement spot when you book. We'd rather catch a placement issue at the quote stage than at the curb.</p>
